The starter ships with a global stylesheet and utility classes. In this chapter you will add your own styles to the home page.

## Global styles

Import the global stylesheet once, in the root layout:

```tsx title="app/layout.tsx"
import './ui/global.css';

export default function RootLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body>{children}</body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

## Practice: a shape with utility classes

Add a black triangle to the home page, above the heading, using only border utilities.

:::expandable{title="Reveal the solution" style="solution"}
```tsx title="app/page.tsx"
<div className="h-0 w-0 border-b-[30px] border-l-[20px] border-r-[20px] border-b-black border-l-transparent border-r-transparent" />
```
:::

:::quiz{data=""}:::

Pages are server components by default, so they can read the database directly.

```ts title="app/lib/data.ts"
export async function fetchLatestInvoices() {
  return sql`SELECT amount, name, email FROM invoices ORDER BY date DESC LIMIT 5`;
}
```

```tsx title="app/dashboard/page.tsx"
export default async function Page() {
  const latest = await fetchLatestInvoices();
  return <LatestInvoices invoices={latest} />;
}
```

:::hint{style="warning"}
Requests that do not depend on each other should start together. Waiting for each in turn makes the page as slow as all of them added up.
:::

A form can call a server action directly. No API route, no client-side fetch.

```ts title="app/lib/actions.ts"
'use server';

export async function updateInvoice(id: string, form: FormData) {
  const amount = Number(form.get('amount'));
  await sql`UPDATE invoices SET amount = ${amount} WHERE id = ${id}`;
  revalidatePath('/dashboard/invoices');
}
```

## Practice: validate the amount

Refuse an amount that is not a positive number before it reaches the database.

:::expandable{title="Reveal the solution" style="solution"}
```ts title="app/lib/actions.ts"
if (!Number.isFinite(amount) || amount <= 0) return { message: 'Enter an amount above zero.' };
```
:::
